# Step 28, its third pull request's first part: custom commands, the fixes
# of the early review in `cineris_ext::commands` (L1, a user's broken file,
# L4). No project's command is used when the user's folder of commands was
# not read whole; a user's file that cannot be used still holds its name;
# and a project's command holds nothing that acts unseen. Broken one at a
# time, with the tests that must fail.

